Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 00:23:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Fix MMI check bypass via leading whitespace in tel URI.

- Ensure we use the number extracted from getNumberFromCallIntent which
does a bunch of correctness checks already.
- Add a second line of defense in MmiUtils to ensure the number
is in the correct format.

Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Test: atest MmiUtilsTest NewOutgoingCallIntentBroadcasterTest
Bug: 508585261
